  2741	  | ``11010nnn``              | Pop VFP double-precision registers D[8]-D[8+nnn] saved (as if) by VPUSH (see **remark d**)                   |
  2742	  +---------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
  2743	  | ``11xxxyyy``              | Spare (xxx != 000, 001, 010)                                                                                 |
